{
  "about": "Fictional call-types/1 vectors (AUT-629, AUT-341 decision 1). No customer text or IDs. Each input overrides base; phase rows are [name, start_ms] and objection_spans rows are [start_ms, end_ms]; expected is the one key the rule must return. thresholds must equal the exported constant in both twins and the proposed values in profiles/call_types_v1.json.",
